msgctxt "92"
msgid "Sorry to keep you waiting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Dad... This is Kazuma Kiryu, the guy I was telling you about over the phone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Pleasure to meet you, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "...Hmm. I'm Mika's father."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Dad... Kiryu-san and I are getting married."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "That's why I moved to Okinawa. I wanted to be with him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"It's all right, Dad. Kiryu-san is going to take care of me, and we're going "
"to have a beautiful life together!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "You don't have to worry about me anymore. I'll be fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "...Hmm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid "Hehe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Tell me, Kiryu-san, do you truly love my daughter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Do you think you can make her happy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "I promise I will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "I see... Let's put your feelings to the test, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Come on out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"This guy here is one of our family bodyguards. He's here to keep our family "
"safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "What are you doing, Dad!? Stop this right now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "You be quiet! Let Dad handle this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Hehehe... You ready for an ass whoopin'?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Then I'm gonna make sure you get it!"
msgstr ""

